deo content creation"]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"ig-section ig-gr-content"},["H3",{"class":"title"},"Snapinsta - Online Instagram Downloader"],["P",{},["B",{},"What is Snapinsta?"]," Snapinsta is an Instagram image and video downloader tool, allowing you to save photos and videos from IG to your device easily and conveniently. All processing is done on our server side."],["P",{},"All you need to do is copy the post link of the photo, video you want to download on Instagram, paste it into the input box on Snapinsta and press the Download button. That's it, very simple and easy to use."],["P",{},["IMG",{"__playwright_current_src__":"https://snapinsta.to/imgs/banner-min.png","loading":"lazy","src":"/imgs/banner-min.png","width":"800","height":"460","alt":"SnapInsta"}]],["P",{"class":"center"},["I",{},"Best Instagram Downloader"]],["P",{},"With Snapinsta app, you will easily download any of your favorite Instagram posts. This is a global application, supporting most popular languages ​​(over 20 languages) and is continuously updated to bring the best experience to users."]],["DIV",{"class":"ig-section ig-gr-content"},["H3",{"class":"title"},"How to use Snapinsta - Instagram Downloader?"],["UL",{"class":"ol-decorated"},["LI",{},"Open the Instagram app or website and log in to your account."],["LI",{},"Find and copy the Instagram post link (Photo, Video, Reels, Story, Profile) you want to download."],["DIV",{"class":"google-auto-placed ap_container","style":"width: 100%; height: auto; clear: both; text-align: center;"},["INS",{"data-ad-format":"auto","class":"adsbygoogle adsbygoogle-noablate","data-ad-client":"ca-pub-3831853078543758","data-adsbygoogle-status":"done","style":"display: block; margin: auto; background-color: transparent; height: 280px;"},["DIV",{"id":"aswift_3_host","style":"border: none; height: 280px; width: 1050px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; position: relative; visibility: visible; background-color: transparent; display: inline-block;"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"google-auto-placed ap_container","style":"width: 100%; height: auto; clear: both; text-align: center;"},["INS",{"data-ad-format":"auto","class":"adsbygoogle adsbygoogle-noablate","data-ad-client":"ca-pub-3831853078543758","data-adsbygoogle-status":"done","style":"display: block; margin: auto; background-color: transparent; height: 280px;"},["DIV",{"id":"aswift_2_host","style":"border: none; height: 280px; width: 1050px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; position: relative; visibility: visible; background-color: transparent; display: inline-block;"}]]],["LI",{},"Return to Snapinsta, paste the copied URL into the input box, and press the \"Download\" button."],["LI",{},"Wait for our server to extract the data and then save the photo or video to your device."],["LI",{},"Done. Open the photo or video you just downloaded on your device and enjoy it."]]],["DIV",{"class":"ig-section guide-area ig-gr-content"},["H3",{"class":"title"},"Why should you use the Snapinsta downloader?"],["P",{},"Instagram's (IG, Insta) policy does not allow users to save photos or videos to your device for offline viewing. The best way to download content from Instagram is to use the Snapinsta downloader."],["P",{},"Snapinsta has a simple, user-friendly interface that allows you to download photos and videos from Instagram to your device in a few easy steps. This tool does not collect user data and does not store users' download history, making the use of Snapinsta.to completely anonymous."],["DIV",{"class":"google-auto-placed ap_container","style":"width: 100%; height: auto; clear: both; text-align: center;"},["INS",{"data-ad-format":"auto","class":"adsbygoogle adsbygoogle-noablate","data-ad-client":"ca-pub-3831853078543758","data-adsbygoogle-status":"done","style":"display: block; margin: auto; background-color: transparent; height: 280px;"},["DIV",{"id":"aswift_5_host","style":"border: none; height: 280px; width: 1100px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; position: relative; visibility: visible; background-color: transparent; display: inline-block;"}]]],["DIV",{"class":"google-auto-placed ap_container","style":"width: 100%; height: auto; clear: both; text-align: center;"},["INS",{"data-ad-format":"auto","class":"adsbygoogle adsbygoogle-noablate","data-ad-client":"ca-pub-3831853078543758","data-adsbygoogle-status":"done","style":"display: block; margin: auto; background-color: transparent; height: 280px;"},["DIV",{"id":"aswift_4_host","style":"border: none; height: 280px; width: 1100px; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; position: relative; visibility: visible; background-color: transparent; display: inline-block;"}]]],["P",{},"According to user votes, Snapinsta is the best Instagram downloader currently available. Developed and operated by a team with many years of experience, it supports both web and app platforms, allowing users to download any content on IG quickly and conveniently."]],["DIV",{"class":"ig-section section-left ig-gr-content"},["SECTION",{"itemscope":"","itemtype":"https://schema.org/FAQPage"},["DIV",{"class":"section_faq"},["H3",{"class":"title center"},"Frequently Asked Questions"],["DIV",{"class":"faq_item active","itemprop":"mainEntity","itemscope":"","itemtype":"https://schema.org/Question"},["H4",{"itemprop":"name"},"What is the Snapinsta downloader?"],["DIV",{"class":"faq_item_content","id":"divId1","itemprop":"acceptedAnswer","itemscope":"","itemtype":"https://schema.org/Answer"},["DIV",{"itemprop":"text"},"Snapinsta is an Instagram downloader, helping you to quickly download Photos, Videos, Reels, Stories, and Profiles from Instagram to your phone or computer."]]],["DIV",{"class":"faq_item active","itemprop":"mainEntity","itemscope":"","itemtype":"https://schema.org/Question"},["H4",{"itemprop":"name"},"Does Snapinsta work on iPhone/iPad?"],["DIV",{"class":"faq_item_content","id":"divId3","itemprop":"acceptedAnswer","itemscope":"","itemtype":"https://schema.org/Answer"},["DIV",{"itemprop":"text"},"For iPhone, you need to use the ",["B",{},"Safari"]," browser on iOS 13 or download the ",["B",{},"Documents by Readdle"]," app and visit Snapinsta.to → Paste the Instagram URL into the input box → press the \"Download\" button (",["A",{"target":"_blank","href":"https://snapinsta.to/en/how-to-download-instagram-photos-and-videos-on-iphone"},"view the tutorial here"],")."]]],["DIV",{"class":"faq_item active","itemprop":"mainEntity","itemscope":"","itemtype":"https://schema.org/Question"},["H4",{"itemprop":"name"},"How to download Instagram videos and photos on Android?"],["DIV",{"class":"faq_item_content","id":"divId4","itemprop":"acceptedAnswer","itemscope":"","itemtype":"https://schema.org/Answer"},["DIV",{"itemprop":"text"},"Downloading IG photos and videos on Android devices is similar to on PC. You need to copy the URL of the Instagram photo and video you want to download → Go back to Snapinsta.to → Paste the copied URL into the input box → click the Download button."]]],["DIV",{"class":"faq_item active","itemprop":"mainEntity","itemscope":"","itemtype":"https://schema.org/Question"},["H4",{"itemprop":"name"},"Does Snapinsta.to keep a copy or store the downloaded videos?"],["DIV",{"class":"faq_item_content","id":"divId5","itemprop":"acceptedAnswer","itemscope":"","itemtype":"https://schema.org/Answer"},["DIV",{"itemprop":"text"},"Snapinsta.to does not store videos and also does not keep copies of the downloaded videos. Additionally, we do not collect user data. Therefore, using Snapinsta is completely anonymous."]]],["DIV",{"class":"faq_item active","itemprop":"mainEntity","itemscope":"","itemtype":"https://schema.org/Question"},["H4",{"itemprop":"name"},"Does Snapinsta.to support downloading Instagram photos and videos in private mode?"],["DIV",{"class":"faq_item_content","id":"divId6","itemprop":"acceptedAnswer","itemscope":"","itemtype":"https://schema.org/Answer"},["DIV",{"itemprop":"text"},"Sure, you need to use ",["A",{"target":"_blank","href":"https://snapinsta.to/en/instagram-private-downloader"},"Instagram Private Downloader"]," and follow the instructions to download Instagram photos and videos from private account easily and quickly."]]],["DIV",{"class":"faq_item active","itemprop":"mainEntity","itemscope":"","itemtype":"https://schema.org/Question"},["H4",{"itemprop":"name"},"Do I need to log in to my Instagram account?"],["DIV",{"class":"faq_item_content","id":"divId7","itemprop":"acceptedAnswer","itemscope":"","itemtype":"https://schema.org/Answer"},["DIV",{"itemprop":"text"},"No, Snapinsta.to does not require you to log in to your Instagram account. Therefore, using our Instagram downloader is very safe and secure."]]],["DIV",{"class":"faq_item active","itemprop":"mainEntity","itemscope":"","itemtype":"https://schema.org/Question"},["H4",{"itemprop":"name"},"Is the Snapinsta.to downloader free of charge?"],["DIV",{"class":"faq_item_content","id":"divId8","itemprop":"acceptedAnswer","itemscope":"","itemtype":"https://schema.org/Answer"},["DIV",{"itemprop":"text"},"Certainly. Snapinsta.to is a free Instagram downloader. You can download Instagram photos and videos without any limits."]]],["DIV",{"class":"faq_item active","itemprop":"mainEntity","itemscope":"","itemtype":"https://schema.org/Question"},["H4",{"itemprop":"name"},"I can't find the photos and videos after downloading?"],["DIV",{"class":"faq_item_content","id":"divId9","itemprop":"acceptedAnswer","itemscope":"","itemtype":"https://schema.org/Answer"},["DIV",{"itemprop":"text"},"Please check the \"Downloads\" folder in your phone or the \"download history\" section of your browser."]]]]]],["DIV",{"class":"ig-section disclaimer"},["DIV",{"class":"terms-note"},["P",{},"Snapinsta is developed to help you save and download photos or videos that you have uploaded yourself. We reserve the right not to provide service if you use this tool to violate the copyright or privacy rights of others."],["P",{},"Read our Terms of Service ",["A",{"href":"/terms-of-service","target":"_blank"},"👉here👈"]]]]],["DIV",{"class"